+// the value in unsigned 32-bit integer a. The rounding mode may contain any of
+// the following flags: _MM_ROUND_NEAREST, _MM_ROUND_DOWN, _MM_ROUND_UP,
+// _MM_ROUND_TOWARD_ZERO
